  "cost": 0,
  "interpretation": "<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th><strong>Component</strong></th>\n<th><strong>Normal/Expected Finding</strong></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Cellularity</strong></td>\n<td>Age-related: ~100% - age (e.g. 70% in a 30-year-old)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Myeloid:Erythroid (M:E) Ratio</strong></td>\n<td>2:1 to 4:1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Maturation Pattern</strong></td>\n<td>Cells of all stages present and progressing normally</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Blast Cells</strong></td>\n<td>&lt; 5% (in adults)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Megakaryocytes (platelet precursors)</strong></td>\n<td>Present in normal number, morphology intact</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Lymphocytes, Plasma Cells</strong></td>\n<td>Seen in small numbers</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Iron Stores (if stained)</strong></td>\n<td>Mild iron presence (absent or increased can suggest anemia or overload)</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
