      "type": "textEditor",
      "data": {
        "value": "<p><strong>Bone Marrow Aspiration Study</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Clinical History-&nbsp;</strong></p>\n<p><strong>CBC and P/S - </strong></p>\n<p><strong>Bone marrow aspirate smear:&nbsp; </strong>Received 10 BMA smears.</p>\n<p><strong>Smears</strong>:&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Normal hematopoietic elements are sparse.</p>\n<table class=\"cke_show_border\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Total nucleated cells counted&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</td>\n<td>:500</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Nucleated differential cell count</strong></td>\n<td>%age</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Blasts</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Erythroid Precursors</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Lymphocytes</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\">&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><strong>Impression: Acute Leukemia.</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Advice: Immunophenotyping and molecular work up.</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div class=\"ephox-dragster-blocker\" style=\"position: fixed; left: 0px; top: 0px; width: 100%; height: 100%;\" role=\"presentation\">&nbsp;</div>",
